<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Reset Your Password</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f4f4f4; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .container { max-width: 560px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.1); }
    .header { background: #c0392b; padding: 24px 32px; }
    .header h1 { color: #fff; margin: 0; font-size: 22px; }
    .body { padding: 32px; color: #333; }
    .otp { font-size: 36px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 8px; color: #c0392b; background: #fdf0ef; padding: 16px 24px; border-radius: 6px; display: inline-block; margin: 16px 0; }
    .footer { padding: 16px 32px; background: #f9f9f9; color: #888; font-size: 12px; text-align: center; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header"><h1>SentinelAuth — Password Reset</h1></div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>Hi {{name}},</p>
      <p>We received a request to reset your password. Use the code below. It expires in <strong>{{expiryMinutes}} minutes</strong>.</p>
      <div class="otp">{{code}}</div>
      <p>If you didn't request this, please secure your account immediately.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">© SentinelAuth. Do not reply to this email.</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
